	},
	{
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020180"},
		line=1739,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Boy, all's well that ends well, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I seriously thought I'd never see y'all ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"It's lunchtime, and Shino is acting as cheerful as ever.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't jinx it for us now.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“There's a total media blackout going on, so it must've gotten pretty hairy, right?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Just as Shino said, there hasn't been a single news report about what happened at the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"However, the atmosphere around the Imperial Palace has been positively murderous ever since the other day.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"We'll have to keep our heads down for a while.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“After putting your necks on the chopping block like that,\nit's a shame you came back totally empty-handed.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'd say these two have their hands preeetty full.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari looks meaningfully between me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whoa, no kidding?!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm jealous, so freaking jealous!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Shino takes out her frustration on her fried chicken.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You two should, um, you know, show a little more restraint. The dojo of all places...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmph!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Hotori nearly spits out her miso soup.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, you saw that?!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh, you totally knew I was coming by later, didn't you?!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you think I sorta have the right to be mad?!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She's not wrong.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ummm, what exactly might you two have been doing in the dojo?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Uh, well...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sexu─”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmph!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oof...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"A swift chop to the neck puts Shino's lights out.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, would you mind repeating that?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry about what Shino said.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But well, you know, Hotori and I...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Kissed.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whyyy would you tell her?!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Hotori leaps out of her chair, her face stained bright red.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"This, however, only has the effect of drawing the entire\ncafeteria's attention to her, and she meekly sits back down.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Then, the two of you are, um... *Gulp.*”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Ah, in that case!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Kotone triumphantly lays a brochure of some sort on the table.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"“Plan Your Perfect Imperial Wedding!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“By all means, please hold your ceremony at the Imperial Temple!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you book now for this coming spring, we would gladly throw in a special discount!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Tough customer!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"When I politely decline, Kotone's enthusiasm instantly deflates.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It isn't easy being the Exalt-Priestess, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The head office in Iseya can be more than a little demanding.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is managed by a preeminent acquaintance of mine from the seminary who is, shall we say, rather enthusiastic about her duties.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Kotone explains with a mirthless smile.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ah, that's right!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Shino suddenly sits back up as though nothing happened.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We've got a mighty fine Bridal Division in the Group.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“How 'bout celebrating your new life together with a Republican-style ceremony?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just say the word, and we'll set up a fireworks show and send you down the aisle in a gondola.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Who do you think you're talking to again?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, figured...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All jokes aside, I'm rooting for you two.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do have a long and happy life together.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But, Miyaguni...”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's quite all right. Why, I don't mind in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"So she says, but the foot stomping down on my own seems to indicate otherwise.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"We really should have reported it to our lord first.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then I'm gonna come out and say it, too.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I never expected everyone to be so supportive of us.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As a warrior, I never thought I'd ever get to experience such joy in the first place...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Deeply moved, Hotori closes her eyes and launches into her monologue.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You see, Soujin and I first met...”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're starting there?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's gonna take a lot longer than this lunch break.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"A chorus of silent nods proves my point.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh... Sorry, guess I got carried away.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nah, nah, you gotta do what you gotta do.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“By all means, get carried away. We'd totally be down to hear all about your happy fun times.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ain't that right, Miyaguni?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Go ahead and brag to us aaall you want.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“C-Could it be that we are about to hear the unabridged account of that aforementioned kiss?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Uh, that's going a bit too...”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"In spite of her words, Hotori's blushing expression betrays that she's enjoying the attention quite a bit more than\nshe's letting on.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"At this rate, she's going to get strung along by the others and end up singing like a canary.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come on, Hotori. That's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same for you girls. We're going to be doing it a lot more from now on, so I'd rather you not go crazy about it every time.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Doing it... a lot more...?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are we not?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Uhhh, yeah... we will...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Hotori stares up at me with sparkling eyes.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh god, get a room, you two.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wow... Such power...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, a toast to their new life!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Despite their ways of showing it, I can tell they're all sincerely happy for us.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You girls, really... Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Hotori and I share a contented smile with each other.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"It's mysterious how just that is enough to set me completely at ease.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, you have changed a little, have you not?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How so?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It feels as though your disposition has become gentler now.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Previously, you always seemed to be laboring under a heavy burden of guilt.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Almost as though you were forbidding yourself to ever smile.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm, I wonder...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"When someone gets it right on the money like that, I suppose all you can do is put on a smile.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"After school─",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Hotori and I walk through the courtyard side by side.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Akari left ahead of us in order to give us some alone time.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, can I ask you a favor?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure, what is it?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Um, well...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"She mulls over her words for some time before snapping her head up and...",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teeeeeei!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teyaaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa there.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Hotori claps herself on the cheeks, each time letting out a spirited shout that wouldn't be out of place in the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She turns to face me, her cheeks comically swollen.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, just needed to psych myself up a little.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uh... Uh-huh.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I find myself lost for words at just how high-strung she is.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, what's up?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It won't take long, so could I have some of your time?!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You see, I wanted to go shopping, and...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I’d love it if you could come with me... if you're okay with it, that is...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She slowly trails off as her nerves get the better of her.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"In the end, she resorts to silently looking up at me with puppy dog eyes.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You mean it?!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Her loud voice startles me.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're really gonna go shopping with me?! Are you sure? Are you really sure!?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the big deal? Is a monster gonna show up if we go shopping together?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Absolutely not. I won't let it!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If a monster dares to butt in, I'll kill it with my bare hands!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"She continues ranting incomprehensibly for quite some time.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"It's downright adorable.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, when are we going?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tomorrow's Saturday, so how about then? I'll call you later to arrange a time and place.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“B-By the way, we don't have to invite anyone else... right?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, there's no need.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“W-Well, I guess it'll just be the two of us!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"She's doing a terrible job at hiding how happy she really is.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The next morning.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"While I'm waiting at our meeting place, I spot Hotori running towards me at full speed, her long hair fluttering behind her nearly horizontally.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Her terrifying speed stupefies the bystanders around us.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Hotori slides to a stop in front of me like a gust of wind.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Only then does her hair finally decide to obey the laws of gravity.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Naturally, she isn't even breaking a sweat.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, Soujin. Did you wait long?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I just got here early.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whew, thank goodness.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When I saw you here, I got worried 'cause I thought I was late.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"If she'd thought to check her watch, she would've realized that there's still plenty of time.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"But saying that would probably be tactless.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was more worried about all the bystanders.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine. I'm always careful when I run.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"She proudly declares as she strikes a Natsumi-like pose.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"But today, Hotori is dressed like an ordinary civilian.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"In my opinion, this look suits her the best of all.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"As I drink in the sight of her, my heart starts to beat uncharacteristically fast.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How 'bout we get going?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Without even asking where we're going, I fall into place next to Hotori as she sets off.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So, um, about today...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I actually haven't decided where we should go yet.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"She says with a bashful smile as she gauges my reaction.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For now, can we just walk around like this for a bit?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I might think of somewhere to go after a little while.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I don't mind. It's a nice day for a stroll.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Side by side, we wander about with no particular destination in mind.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I can't imagine a more peaceful way to spend the day.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"The gentle morning sun. The comfortable rays of spring sunshine shining down on me.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"But most importantly of all, the girl right by my side.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I can't imagine a more fulfilling way to spend the rest of my days.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, a cat!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"A cat lounging by the side of the road languidly raises its head towards us.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Hotori squats down beside the cat.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here, kitty, kitty...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"She waggles her finger, and the cat nuzzles its cheek against her outstretched hand.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Seeing how kindly it takes to her presence, Hotori lets out a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"It's a soft, warm, girlish smile, one that I haven't seen on her in a very long time.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wonder if he's someone's pet.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“C'mere, c'mere, lemme give you some cuddles.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"When she picks the cat up, the bell around its neck lets out a tinkle.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"It twitches its little nose and sniffs at Hotori's bag.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"It seems awfully curious about the contents.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehee, are you hungry?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, though. I can't let you have this.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"When she sets it down, the cat gives her one last reluctant look before disappearing into the nearby bushes.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"After parting ways with the cat, we head off on our way.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"We continue meandering around town for some time on our long stroll with no destination.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"It's been a long time since I've felt this relaxed─perhaps not since the war ended.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"All around us, we hear the sounds of shopkeepers eagerly hawking their wares to the crowds passing by.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"All around us, we see the sights of frolicking children dragging their helplessly smiling parents around by the hand.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"The scenery of the town is so idyllic and peaceful that for the briefest of moments, I can almost forget the current situation the Empire is in.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"But the sight of an armed Republican soldier standing on a street corner snaps me back to reality.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"This is no more than an illusory peace built on a bed of falsehoods.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Suddenly, a soft sensation tightly wraps around my arm.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Hotori is grabbing onto my arm with both of her own, hugging it close to her body.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"I blurt out in an attempt to try and hide how flustered I am on the inside.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"With this pillowy softness pressed against me, it takes everything I have to maintain my composure. ",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Even on the battlefield, my heart has never gone so awry, so how is it that I'm feeling this panicked now of all times?",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll be able to blend in better this way, right?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's go!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Our bodies tightly pressed together, we pass right under the soldier's nose.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I'm sure that they could never even imagine that the warriors who attacked the Imperial Palace the other day would be so brazenly walking about in public.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Since we've come all this way, is there any shopping you wanna get done?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I was just thinking of buying a new polishing stone.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Polishing stones are one of the many tools we need for maintaining our blades.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yogarasu District is pretty far from here.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, right. Silly me.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oooohh, here we were supposed to spend today as a normal couple, and I went and blew it...”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"At the end of the day, we'll never not be warriors.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"No matter where we go, the first thing on our minds will always be our blades.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, how about one of those?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I point to a nearby stall selling dango.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"It must be very popular, as the line stretches around the block.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, no.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everything around these parts is usually way too expensive.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors must strive for simplicity and frugality in all things. It's unconscionable to waste money on frivolities like this.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Still holding onto my arm, Hotori yanks me away from the stall.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Besides, if we eat that now, you'll be too full...”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, it's getting close to lunchtime,\nisn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"We've actually been walking around for quite a while.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Are you feeling hungry?”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was just starting to, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Really? I just happened to make lunch.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's go eat over there.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Hotori points towards a sun-dappled bench on a street corner.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"It's located in a cozy-looking park, overlooking a small stream.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"As soon as we sit down side by side, Hotori withdraws a carefully wrapped lunchbox from the bag she'd been carrying all day.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Ah, this must have been what that cat was after.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...I hope you like it.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I'll like it.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How can you be so sure if you haven't even tried it yet?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I mean, it's ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"your",
{"/font"},
" cooking. How long have you been feeding me like this already?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, oooh... Even so...”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You never know, right? It might be not so good today.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I might have screwed it up, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah. Stop worrying.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"The first thing that greets my eyes when I take off the lid is a colorful array of rice balls.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"There is a veritable cornucopia of flavors, everything from simple seaweed to seasoned salmon to salted plum.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"The rice balls are further accompanied by a generous spread of seasonal vegetables, tempura, and stewed fish.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"And naturally, there's the essential daily serving of tofu in the form of both tofu salad and miso tofu.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"I'm honestly a little moved that she went so far out of her way to prepare all my favorite foods like this.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Go on, go on, eat up!”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't mind if I do.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"I immediately start digging into a rice ball.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Naturally, the taste is simply sublime.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"The beautiful assortment of rice balls looks almost too good to eat, but with so many flavors to choose from, I could devour them all day long.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mmm, each one is better than the last!”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"I proceed to scarf down the side dishes.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Just as their mouthwatering appearance suggests, each one is a perfectly balanced medley of seasonal ingredients.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"It must have taken her ages to prepare all of this.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"I'm hardly the most knowledgeable about cooking, but I can at least appreciate the amount of effort that goes into it.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"All the while, Hotori contentedly watches me eat with a bashful smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Did I maybe make a little too much?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I can handle this much.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"I briefly pause to reply before going back to stuffing my face.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Couldn't you... slow down a little and savor it more?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But still, it's always so much fun just watching you eat.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've been making you breakfast since forever now... and\nyou've never once left anything uneaten.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A woman's heart is a complex thing, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're the only one who treats me like a woman, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"At this, my eyes involuntarily flicker over to hers.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"She immediately averts her gaze in embarrassment and makes a show of rummaging through her bag.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...How about some tea?”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"She takes out a thermos and pours out a cup for me.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Sitting shoulder to shoulder, we sip at the warm tea.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"High above in the clear blue sky, the spring sun shines its refreshing rays down on us.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wish I could spend forever with you, just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, me too.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"But deep down, we both know that this peaceful interlude cannot last for long.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Our sworn duty to restore the Empire still remains yet unfinished.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"And so, just for today, I want to make the most of our time together.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Before I know it, Hotori has fallen into a gentle slumber, her head resting on my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"She must have woken up especially early today.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"All for the sake of making such an elaborate lunch for me.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"I imagine the feelings she must have packed into each ingredient, and think back to the restless anticipation in her eyes as she watched for my reaction.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"The thought warms me even more than the comfortable body heat I feel from her as she nods off against my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"After lunch, we leisurely stroll through the shopping district, treasuring our every moment together.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"The street is lined with all manner of stalls, but Hotori barely shows any interest in what they have to offer.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Until, seemingly interested in a certain stall, she stops right in her tracks.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"I peek over her shoulder to spot a colorful assortment of fashion accessories on display.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Spot anything you want?”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“N-No, not really...”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"She stammers this out, but her eyes still remain glued to a certain hair ornament.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Hotori has never been one for flashy accessories, but she seems to have taken a particular interest in this ornament.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"She must be really fond of it.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could I get this, please?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"I call out to the shopkeeper.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine! I don't need it.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you want it, don't you? Let me treat you.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just got my paycheck the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But it's your hard-earned money. You should spend it on yourself...”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Consider it a memento for today. I want you to have it.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"I quickly pay for the ornament and the shopkeeper wraps it up with a smile. ",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"I turn around and hand the gift-wrapped package to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Th-Thank you...”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll always treasure it.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"She gently cradles it to her chest with an adorable smile.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Only as the last rays of twilight fade away do we reluctantly begin to head home.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Our fairytale-like time together is finally coming to an end.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"My footsteps are uncharacteristically heavy as we slowly wend our way back towards Nando District.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"That is, until...",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"The two of us stop dead in our tracks at the exact same time.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How long do you intend to keep following us?”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"I call out without turning around.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I hear a sharp gasp from behind us, one that sounds awfully familiar...",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“I-I wasn't hiding, or anything...”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"Two people guiltily shuffle out from a nearby alleyway.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"One is Akari.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"And the other is...",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh dear, it seems we've been noticed.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mutsumi?!”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, do not blame Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I was the one who made the suggestion.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"Apparently Akari and Mutsumi-san happened to run into each other earlier today, after which they happened to spot me and Hotori and decided to tail us.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Are you mad at me for dragging Soujin around all on my own?”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Why would I be angry?”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Because he's your vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And I selfishly took away so much of his time...”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold on! Hold it right there!”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now look here, you. I'm not that small-minded, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I already gave you two my blessing, and if I ever did really need him, I wouldn't hesitate to drag him away from your little tryst or whatnot.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Uuh...”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Hotori flounders for words under Akari's tongue-lashing.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“W-Well, I wouldn't call this a tryst, per se...”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's the problem?!”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just needed to do some shopping, and...”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Enough out of you!”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Hotori jolts up straight as an arrow.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think you two are better off together.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your battle the other day taught me that all too well.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni...”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So barring any exceptional circumstances, you can spend all the time you want together with no objections from me.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you. I'll never forget this!”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"Akari gives Hotori's hands a squeeze, and Hotori offers her a bow in return.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"All the while, Mutsumi-san simply watches the two of them with a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That advice you gave me back then, I think I understand it a little better now.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh? Whatever might that have been?”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To let my blade convey my feelings instead.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was, well... I'm not sure how to describe it.”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Joyous, was it not?”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san graces me with a rarely seen coquettish smile.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's this about?”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, our little secret.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, please do stay by Soujin-sama's side forevermore.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“To fight alongside the one you love and burn your lives away together is a special privilege reserved for us warrior women.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You just might have a point.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's about time I stop regretting those things I can't change about myself.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, that would be for the best.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"Akari and Mutsumi-san eventually take their leave.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"As we chatted together, twilight already gave way to dusk.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"Though it's spring, the nights are still cold.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			{
"Hotori and I wander the lonely streets lit only by streetlamps.",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks for everything today.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've always dreamed of, just once, being able to live like an ordinary girl.”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Walking around town with the man I love, feeding him my homemade lunch, having him buy me a present to cherish the memory with...”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All I wanted was just one single day.”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All I wanted... was to be able to spend a little time together, the way a real couple would.”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So thank you, Soujin. You granted my deepest wish.”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"Peering up at me, Hotori puts on her best smile.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"Even so, she doesn't quite manage to hide the forlorn look in her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But now, that time is over.”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Starting tomorrow, I'll go back to being a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"The shop is within sight now.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"My time with Hotori is rapidly approaching its end.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well then...”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait!”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"Hotori turns around with a start.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The day isn't over yet.”",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"I don't want this dream to end either.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh...?”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're still lovers, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"I draw her in by the hand and wrap my arm tightly around her waist.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"Our faces close enough for our breaths to tickle each other, we stare into each other's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I love you, Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What's gotten into you all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're acting weird...”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"Hotori bashfully averts her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just wanted to say it once more.”",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"I just wanted to give shape to these ineffable feelings swirling around within me and convey them however I could.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"I have no memories of having ever fallen in love.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"I believe my feelings for Hotori go far beyond those of romantic love.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"But even so, in this moment, I can't think of any better words to express all that I feel for her besides these─",
			},
		},
		[392]={
